      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "uid": "timescaledb"
          },
          "rawSql": "/* NO_TIMEFILTER_INTENTIONAL: full dataset scope */\nSELECT a.logdate AS \"Time\",a.equipmentid AS \"Machine\",a.errorcode AS \"errorcode\",\n COALESCE(m.alarm_msg,a.errorcode::TEXT) AS \"Message\",COALESCE(m.alarm_type,'UNMAPPED') AS \"Severity\"\nFROM public.ldi_alarm_log a LEFT JOIN public.ldi_alarm_ms_code m ON a.errorcode::TEXT=m.alarm_code::TEXT\nWHERE a.equipmentid IN (${machine_id:sqlstring}) ORDER BY a.logdate DESC LIMIT 20;",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transparent": true,
      "description": "Note: Alarm durations and MTTR are not calculated as the source EAP system currently does not broadcast explicit alarm-clear events. Only occurrence times are logged. Duration estimation requires EAP team confirmation of clear/reset event availability. Alarm Stream: latest alarms with human-readable messages and color-coded severity."
